    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέστιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without hearth and home,
				homeless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαις τε κἀγύναιξ κἀνέστιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1266
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄοικος καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Sacr.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.Mynd.
				59
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					14.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>savage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.417
				</span></i>
			.</div>
